WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.040 align:start position:19%
somebody else will say it.
Two weeks ago at 3:32 a.m., I woke in my

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:13.480 align:start position:19%
own bed wide awake, like somebody
whispered my name.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:17.920 align:start position:19%
At 3:33, my cell phone rang. No caller
ID, and faintly in the background, an

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:24.840 align:start position:19%
engine idling.
I did not answer. I sat in the dark and

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:30.560 align:start position:19%
counted along. 10 9 8 down to 1.
It stopped. In the silence, a whisper

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:34.720 align:start position:19%
like breath on glass. Jack Doyle,
lock the door.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:39.200 align:start position:19%
If that gave you chills, subscribe.
The next story is the one I have been

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.200 align:start position:19%
afraid to tell.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:45.960 align:start position:19%
